abstract: "Work in Progress — Academic Research Resource. A curated inventory of ecological indicators, working definitions, qualified inferences, classifications, scientific references and candidate observation-source routes. Entries are exploratory research definitions, not verified monitoring standards. No licence has been selected for this repository or its research documentation; public accessibility and citation metadata do not grant reuse permissions. Third-party works and datasets retain their own reuse conditions."
